## Phase 1 is complete when

```text
[ ] Major screens explored
[ ] Major user actions explored
[ ] Major workflows discovered
[ ] Loading states recorded
[ ] Empty states recorded
[ ] Error states recorded
[ ] Persistence behavior investigated
[ ] Network behavior investigated
[ ] Important unknowns documented
```

