# PHASE 2 — MAP THE SYSTEM

## Goal

Turn observations into a map of **capabilities**.

Do NOT create code modules yet.

Do NOT automatically make every screen a module.

---

## Example

Instead of:

```text
HomeScreen
FoodScreen
AnalysisScreen
SocialScreen
ProfileScreen
```

think:

```text
ACCOUNT
 ├── Authentication
 ├── Profile
 └── Settings

NUTRITION
 ├── Food
 ├── Food Search
 ├── Meal Logging
 ├── Daily Nutrition
 └── Nutrition History

ANALYSIS
 ├── Daily Analysis
 ├── Trends
 └── Recommendations

SOCIAL
 ├── Feed
 ├── Posts
 ├── Comments
 ├── Likes
 └── Following
```

These are **capabilities**, not necessarily final modules.

---

## Find relationships

Ask:

> What depends on what?

Example:

```text
Food Logging
      ↓
Meal
      ↓
Daily Nutrition
      ↓
Analysis
      ↓
Recommendations
```

And:

```text
User
 ├── Meals
 ├── Nutrition records
 ├── Posts
 └── Social relationships
```

---

## Phase 2 output

Create:

```text
system-map.md
```

Containing:

```text
Capabilities
Relationships
Major dependencies
Potential domains
Unknown dependencies
```

