# THE CORE DEVELOPMENT LOOP

After the initial discovery:

```text
UNDERSTAND
    ↓
DESIGN
    ↓
IMPLEMENT ONE VERTICAL SLICE
    ↓
TEST
    ↓
OBSERVE WHAT YOU LEARNED
    ↓
REFINE ARCHITECTURE
    ↓
NEXT SLICE
```

Never:

```text
SCREEN
 ↓
CODE
 ↓
NEXT SCREEN
 ↓
PATCH
 ↓
NEXT SCREEN
 ↓
JUGAAD
 ↓
REWRITE
```

