# DEFINITION OF DONE

The application is NOT done merely because:

```text
All screens exist.
```

It is done when:

```text
[ ] Major behavior works
[ ] Domain model is coherent
[ ] Data ownership is clear
[ ] State transitions are understood
[ ] Failure behavior is handled
[ ] Lifecycle is handled
[ ] Concurrency is considered
[ ] Important behavior is tested
[ ] Architecture is maintainable
[ ] New features can be added without hacks
[ ] App is performant enough
[ ] App is secure enough
[ ] App is releasable
```

