# THE QUESTION TO ASK YOURSELF

Whenever you feel:

> "I know this screen. Let me build it."

STOP.

Ask:

```text
What user journey is this part of?

What business concept does it represent?

Who owns the data?

What is the source of truth?

What else changes when this happens?

What rules must remain true?

What happens when it fails?

